{"id":"1cd6ef5cb51a39c5","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-priority-argument.md","title":"Priority Argument","display":"df-priority-argument — Priority Argument","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-priority-argument","aliases":["68-df-priority-argument"],"display":"df-priority-argument — Priority Argument","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursive-function]]","[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]"],"source_location":"not located in supplied Shoenfield PDF; local framework","verification_status":"local-framework-definition","source_proof_status":"not-a-book-theorem","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_basis":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-priority-argument"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-priority-argument</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-priority-argument — Priority Argument"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"not located in supplied Shoenfield PDF; local framework"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-framework-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-a-book-theorem"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))\">\\(R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))\\)</span> 是要求序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(e)\">\\(R(e)\\)</span> 是满足第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 个要求的集合全体。优先次序固定为自然数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>，较小索引优先。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是候选阶段数据；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,s\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(s)=0\">\\(b(s)=0\\)</span> 表示阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 无行动，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(s)=e+1\">\\(b(s)=e+1\\)</span> 表示第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 个策略行动。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{a,s}\">\\(A_{a,s}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Act}\">\\(\\mathrm{Act}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inj}\">\\(\\mathrm{Inj}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PriorityArg}\">\\(\\mathrm{PriorityArg}\\)</span> 在以下引入；此节点限于单调枚举的固定线性优先框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_{a,s}:=\\{x\\le s:a(s,x)=1\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Act}(b,e,s)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;b(s)=e+1,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,s)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists i&lt;e\\;\\mathrm{Act}(b,i,s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_{a,s}:=\\{x\\le s:a(s,x)=1\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Act}(b,e,s)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;b(s)=e+1,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,s)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists i&lt;e\\;\\mathrm{Act}(b,i,s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PriorityArg}(A,R,a,b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\na\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\land b\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\land\n\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(A_{a,s}\\subseteq A_{a,s+1})\\land\nA=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}A_{a,s}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PriorityArg}(A,R,a,b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\na\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\land b\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\land\n\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(A_{a,s}\\subseteq A_{a,s+1})\\land\nA=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}A_{a,s}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地验证接口，借鉴原书 §15 在 p.56/PDF65 对 RE construction 的说明及 15.5 的较小索引优先安排；原书没有本节点四参数谓词。它记录要求、统一有效阶段近似及实际行动事件，不自动断言所有要求满足，也不覆盖所有优先论证（例如树优先或非单调构造）。</p>\n<p>Inj 是“较高优先策略行动会初始化较低策略”的保守重置约定。具体构造若只重置部分策略，应提供自己的实际重置事件，而不能把本事件与所有语境中的 injury 等同。原旧式仅给极限集合与良序、完全不约束行动；本修订明确了一个可检验接口，完整通用方法仍未形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))$ 是要求序列；$R(e)$ 是满足第 $e$ 个要求的集合全体。优先次序固定为自然数的 $<$，较小索引优先。$a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}$、$b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 是候选阶段数据；$e,s\\in\\mathbb N$。其中 $b(s)=0$ 表示阶段 $s$ 无行动，$b(s)=e+1$ 表示第 $e$ 个策略行动。$\\mathrm{TotalRec}$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-function]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))","display":false},{"tex":"R(e)","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"e,s\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"b(s)=0","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"b(s)=e+1","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalRec}","display":false},{"tex":"A_{a,s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Act}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inj}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PriorityArg}","display":false},{"tex":"A_{a,s}:=\\{x\\le s:a(s,x)=1\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Act}(b,e,s)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;b(s)=e+1,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,s)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists i<e\\;\\mathrm{Act}(b,i,s).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PriorityArg}(A,R,a,b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\na\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\land b\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\land\n\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(A_{a,s}\\subseteq A_{a,s+1})\\land\nA=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}A_{a,s}.","display":true}],"bytes":2325,"backlinks":[{"id":"0d2eafa7efbe1e51","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))$，$a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{PriorityArg}$、$\\mathrm{Act}$、$\\mathrm{Inj}$ 见 [[68-df-priority-argument]]。"},{"id":"75703316b975a2ec","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$，$e,s\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{Inj}(b,e,s)$ 采用 [[68-df-priority-argument]] 中的较高优先行动重置约定。$I_b$ 与 $\\mathrm{FinInjury}$ 在以下定义。"},{"id":"0f48822de2ded7de","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{Inj}$ 与 $I_b$ 见 [[68-df-priority-argument]]、[[68-df-finite-injury]]；仍采用较高优先行动重置的固定接口。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[68-df-priority-argument|df-priority-argument — Priority Argument]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-65","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-priority-argument]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-priority-argument|df-priority-argument — Priority Argument]]"}],"outgoing":["a82d826d433dcff3","913d52943499d039"]}